# Isolith Docker build context ignore (P10-M1-T01).
# Context for the OEP stack image is the repo root; keep it small and
# hermetic so `docker build` only ships what cargo needs.
#
# Extended for the contributor devcontainer (CONTRIBUTOR-BUILD-PATH,
# t_845b253d): the devcontainer's docker build context is ALSO the repo root,
# and the same rule applies only more so (a fresh clone + devcontainer build =
# no target dir, no venv, no secrets). Every addition below only shrinks
# contexts for both consumers.

.git
.gitlab
.github
.worktrees
target
**/target
.github/
.idea
.vscode
*.proof.png
**/proof
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
*.log
releases

# Contributor devcontainer / generic build-artifact exclusions (both consumers)
.venv/
build/
dist/
pending-corpus/
*.srl
server.key
P10-M1/certs/
P10-M1/deploy/.env
